    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Loss from operations was $1.7 million for the six months ended March 31, 2024, compared to an income from operations of $0.1 million for the six months ended March 31, 2023, due to the decrease in revenue as discussed above.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
