    <TD STYLE="width: 24px"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&#9679;</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">Net loss was $13.1 million for the six months ended March 31, 2024, compared to a net loss of $0.7 million&nbsp;for the six months ended March 31, 2023. Realized loss on short-term investments from wealth management financial products was $3,094,084 for the six months ended March 31, 2024, compared to short-term investment income of $166,931 for the six months ended March 31, 2023. The Company also recorded change in fair value of short-term investment of $7,617,502 for its investment holdings during the six months ended March 31, 2024. No change in fair value of short-term investment was recognized for the six months ended March 31, 2023.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

